{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":50,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":9962,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1880407,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":281338,"Name":"sbodnar4","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1418687216,"LastPoster":{"Id":284153,"Name":"Ambie","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284153.jpeg?_r=1454355937","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":38,"Preview":{"Id":1880407,"PostDate":1418687216,"PostContent":"Hello Ladies!!! \u00a0 I am very new to this and am looking for help. I have never been to a destinati...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stephbodnar4@gmail.com","IpAddress":"198.161.231.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417989526,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"sbodnar4","Id":281338,"Name":"sbodnar4","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.161.230.10","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b10c9a28a7c1e5d28c7d3a908bd7db9b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello Ladies!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am very new to this and am looking for help. I have never been to a destination wedding but have had lots of advice from other friends who have.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My question is... is there any way of getting my hands on the extras that the RIU Palace in Cabo has before I speak with my wedding coordinator. We are just trying to make up a budget and I only can access the package pricing for their 3 packages that they offer.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If anyone could please help me out. Even if you are a bride that could forward me the email that would be great.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks a million ladies&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880407,"PostDate":1418687216,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Ladies!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am very new to this and am looking for help. I have never been to a destination wedding but have had lots of advice from other friends who have.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My question is... is there any way of getting my hands on the extras that the RIU Palace in Cabo has before I speak with my wedding coordinator. We are just trying to make up a budget and I only can access the package pricing for their 3 packages that they offer.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If anyone could please help me out. Even if you are a bride that could forward me the email that would be great.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks a million ladies<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stephbodnar4@gmail.com","IpAddress":"198.161.231.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417989526,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"sbodnar4","Id":281338,"Name":"sbodnar4","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.42.28.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5de9a5ed01540fbfcd553256e8c27522","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"sbodnar4\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I responded to your earlier post.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m in the same situation and have been trying to obtain information and work out a budget.   So far here&#039;s some other information that I&#039;ve found and\/or obtained from other Riu brides...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s the link to the Riu Palace photographer:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.myweddinginloscabos.net\/blog\/packages-2015-2\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.myweddinginloscabos.net\/blog\/packages-2015-2\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The Riu Palace florist:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/bajaflower.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/bajaflower.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I contacted them through their website inquiring about pricing yesterday and still waiting for their response.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880414,"PostDate":1418697889,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281338\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281338-sbodnar4\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">sbodnar4<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>I responded to your earlier post.\u00a0 I'm in the same situation and have been trying to obtain information and work out a budget.\u00a0\u00a0 So far here's some other information that I've found and\/or obtained from other Riu brides...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here's the link to the Riu Palace photographer:<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.myweddinginloscabos.net\/blog\/packages-2015-2\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.mywedding...ackages-2015-2\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The Riu Palace florist:<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/bajaflower.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bajaflower.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>I contacted them through their website inquiring about pricing yesterday and still waiting for their response.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jrcorrales@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.42.28.220","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413956046,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280778.jpg?_r=1421562169","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmorDeMiVida","Id":280778,"Name":"AmorDeMiVida","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.161.230.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"22957b30fdc6f5417f89aaa34806e5ba","RawContent":"&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/280778-amordemivida\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;AmorDeMiVida&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;thanks so much for all your help. Our wedding is May 10, 2016.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880425,"PostDate":1418740855,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                \n\t<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/280778-amordemivida\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>AmorDeMiVida<\/span><\/a>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>thanks so much for all your help. Our wedding is May 10, 2016.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stephbodnar4@gmail.com","IpAddress":"198.161.231.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417989526,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"sbodnar4","Id":281338,"Name":"sbodnar4","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.15.193.73","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f799005fbef6ed63bd1a4374cb403cab","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m getting married at the Riu Santa Fe (price was better for our guests) in July. I have the Palace extras list for 2014 that they originally sent me when beginning to plan my wedding. It was sent to me as a PDF so I&#039;m not sure how to share it on here? If you want I can email it to you. Let me know if you have any other questions!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Jenna&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880464,"PostDate":1418763803,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm getting married at the Riu Santa Fe (price was better for our guests) in July. I have the Palace extras list for 2014 that they originally sent me when beginning to plan my wedding. It was sent to me as a PDF so I'm not sure how to share it on here? If you want I can email it to you. Let me know if you have any other questions!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Jenna<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenna32schap@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.97.32.162","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1394387100,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277065.jpg?_r=1438546602","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jenna32schap","Id":277065,"Name":"jenna32schap","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.62.214.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisib